  "prefLabel": "Liq 204.03 Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 204.03 Notice. Notice for public hearings and comment concerning rulemaking shall appear within the commission state liquor stores at least 20 calendar days prior to the hearing date(s) and shall provide the same information as required by RSA 541-A:6.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
